  "source_rule": "Each R03 occurrence binds a source, destination, object and carrier in the expanded episode. Preparation transfers connect stock, fabrication handoff, folding and inspection. Measurement transfers connect inspection to the nominated fixture and back only after unmount. Co-location may eliminate travel distance but never custody checks. Missing expanded transfer bindings block execution."
